  "description": "Lightning-fast object mapping library for .NET - 2-4x faster than AutoMapper! Features: Fluent API with Builder Pattern, Async Mapping, Diff Mapping, Snapshot/Restore, Type Converters, Mapping Validator, and more. Zero configuration, maximum performance with 500%+ memory savings in complex scenarios.",
